  "ingredients": [
    "4 large potatoes",
    "1 yellow onion",
    "1 egg, beaten",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour, or more as needed",
    "1 cup vegetable oil for frying, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 200 degrees F (95 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4-PVwRupXWhs8sPxXjNa8MFIHPo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14089-potato-pancake-ddmfs-ingredients-3x4-0858-ab8bbaa4bcf64e52b60bbf674eb6c9dd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14089/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finely grate potatoes and onion into a large bowl. Drain off any excess liquid.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ILOThjvfnbmKoLW7uCZw2aWrHAo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14089-potato-pancake-ddmfs-step-01-3x4-0859-3c774eeab4c64ffaa0d0dca641e3a535.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14089/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in egg, salt, and pepper. Add enough flour to make the mixture thick, about 2 to 4 tablespoons all together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jWDsx9wd_Y2qefWTok8SGK50cSs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14089-potato-pancake-ddmfs-step-02-3x4-0864-bf1b9e6152e8405bbfc48a574b78fc96.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14089/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 1/4 inch of oil in the bottom of a heavy skillet over medium-high heat. Drop 1/4-cup mounds of batter, two or three at a time, into hot oil and flatten with back of a spatula to make 1/2-inch-thick pancakes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/b09QosbRuUgGwmxdyOjHB2Y_yJ0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14089-potato-pancake-ddmfs-step-03-3x4-0867-02f54b67649046c7ab9642eec5125b90.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14089/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry, turning pancakes once, until golden brown and crisp. Transfer to a paper towel–lined plate to drain. Keep warm in the preheated oven until ready to serve. Repeat until all potato mixture is used.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UOwI95AJa-qVFTDhpjxr1uz1MTs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14089-potato-pancake-ddmfs-step-05-3x4-0871-f8869bf9a60a479baf282fd8b652086e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14089/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VaTtvk-sozB3RlYrcryGSTwvyBE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14089-potato-pancake-ddmfs-hero-3x4-0878-6d3296544d2142afa520f28d87a9a742.jpg"
